    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-06-07"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Use the power of Cyclops Superconductor as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the amount of damage Cyclops Superconductor deals due to its reflexive triggered ability."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2024-06-07"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """You don't choose a target for Cyclops Superconductor's last ability at the time it triggers. Rather, a second "reflexive" ability triggers when you pay {E}{E}{E} this way. You choose a target for that ability as it goes on the stack. Each player may respond to this triggered ability as normal."""@en ] .

